  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed dormers due to poor design, bulk and positioning would appear incongruous and visually intrusive, particularly within views of the roofline and as such would fail to be subordinate to the host dwelling and would be out of character with the surrounding. Further to this the proposed dormers would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the adjacent Conservation Area. The harm caused is not outweighed by public benefits and therefore fails to accord with Section 16 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024; Policy D3, and HC1 of the London Plan 2021; Policies 13, 37 and 44 of the DMD 2014; Policies 30 and 31 of the Core Strategy 2010."
